.TH SDL_GetPenDeviceType 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetPenDeviceType \- Get the device type of the given pen.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_pen.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_PenDeviceType SDL_GetPenDeviceType(SDL_PenID instance_id);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Many platforms do not supply this information, so an app must always be prepared to get an
.BR SDL_PEN_DEVICE_TYPE_UNKNOWN
result\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I instance_id
the pen instance ID\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the device type of the given pen, or
.BR SDL_PEN_DEVICE_TYPE_INVALID
on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

